    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Setup Checklist\n\n**Step 1 — Job Search Config node:**\n- Set searchQuery (e.g. \"Werkstudent AI Machine Learning\")\n- Paste your full CV text into baseCV\n- Check notifyEmail is correct\n\n**Step 2 — Claude Model node:**\n- Add Anthropic API credential\n\n**Step 3 — Request Approval + Send Apply Package nodes:**\n- Add Gmail OAuth2 credential on both\n\n**Step 4 — Activate workflow (top right toggle)**\n\nRuns every 6h automatically\nYou get an email per match — click Approve or Skip\nOn approve: full apply package sent to your inbox",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "223fc04d-e606-4dd0-965b-3d6c934c2931",
      "name": "Sticky Note 3ab549f0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Job Source: Arbeitnow\n\nFREE API — NO API key needed!\nSpecialised in Germany jobs:\n- Werkstudent roles\n- English-speaking positions\n- AI / ML / Tech roles\n\nChange searchQuery in Job Search Config\ne.g. \"Werkstudent Data Science\" or\n\"Werkstudent Python Munich\"",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "08c2d97f-174e-4c62-ac89-d59c069ea46b",
      "name": "Sticky Note 0ca38abe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## How Approval Works\n\n1. Claude scores & tailors each job\n2. Only jobs above minRelevance (default 70) get emailed\n3. Email has two buttons:\n   \"Apply to this job\" - sends full package\n   \"Skip this job\" - moves to next\n4. Auto-expires after 7 days if no reply",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "942b134c-6df3-45fb-926e-12379b750b48",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1aa202ff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
